u003Cp\u003E社企不只是好心，更是好生意\u003Cbr\u003E從香港到內地，一場可持續祝福社區的實踐之旅\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E主講嘉賓：\u003Cbr\u003E💡寰宇希望香港執行總監 廖立恆Jonathan\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E分享重點：\u003Cbr\u003E✅揭示社企成功核心： 如何讓公益與盈利共生？\u003Cbr\u003E✅跨越地域的智慧： 香港與內地雙軌實踐中的挑戰與突破\u003Cbr\u003E✅ 個人與企業都能參與的社區祝福行動藍圖： 你的角色不只是聽眾！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E&gt; 若社會企業註定在理想與現實間掙扎，為何寰宇希望能在香港與內地扎根20年，並持續擴大影響力？Jonathan將整合理性的商業模式與感性的人文故事，剖析社企可持續發展的關鍵。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：2026年1月24日（六）\u003Cbr\u003E時間：晚上7:30-9:00\u003Cbr\u003E地點：旺角家樂坊15樓安利體驗館會議室D\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$40\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E適合對象：\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 尋找公益與商業平衡點的創業者\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 關心社區創新的企業管理者\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 非牟利組織工作者及義工\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 任何想讓社會影響力更可持續的人\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2026-01-24","寰宇希望香港執行總監 廖立恆Jonathan","social-enterprise-260124",null,"2025-12-23T03:43:55.011Z",{"data":11},[12],{"id":13,"attributes":14},2,{"name":15,"slug":16,"description":8,"createdAt":17,"updatedAt":18},"名人面對面","be-our-guest","2023-02-12T02:38:55.942Z","2023-03-08T13:16:12.875Z",{"data":20},{"id":21,"attributes":22},85,{"name":23,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":24,"height":25,"formats":26,"hash":56,"ext":28,"mime":31,"size":57,"url":58,"previewUrl":8,"provider":59,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":60,"updatedAt":60},"1c.png",2400,1800,{"large":27,"small":36,"medium":43,"thumbnail":49},{"ext":28,"url":29,"hash":30,"mime":31,"name":32,"path":8,"size":33,"width":34,"height":35},".png","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_1c_04d0ec2ae7.png","large_1c_04d0ec2ae7","image\u002Fpng","large_1c.png",446.47,1000,750,{"ext":28,"url":37,"hash":38,"mime":31,"name":39,"path":8,"size":40,"width":41,"height":42},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_1c_04d0ec2ae7.png","small_1c_04d0ec2ae7","small_1c.png",163.16,500,375,{"ext":28,"url":44,"hash":45,"mime":31,"name":46,"path":8,"size":47,"width":35,"height":48},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_1c_04d0ec2